sum_{k=1}^n f(\\frac{k}{n})$ 的标准形式，也未先用对数性质把指数 $1/n$ 提到对数前。"},"formal_id":"GS-688","history_may_override_current":false,"knowledge":["极限与连续","数列极限","定积分","定积分定义","黎曼和","夹逼准则"],"review_events":[],"scheduling":null,"schema_version":"math-live-learning-state-v1","source_stamps":{"concept_directory":{"ctime_ns":1786566513464499949,"inode":43247501,"mtime_ns":1786566513464499949},"数学一回滚复习系统/复习单元.json":{"ctime_ns":1788330434969648987,"inode":189761659,"mtime_ns":1788330434961667258,"size":1582119},"数学一回滚复习系统/复习记录.jsonl":{"ctime_ns":1788328612946477885,"inode":34903167,"mtime_ns":1788328612946477885,"size":399399}},"source_version":"0ea501b079e89282daa961c91c6f977a97e4a8c5b81b8dff8b8f3f88b2bc9bfd"}
